    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <i>Trade Rivals \u2013 Goblin Age</i>,</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic 2\u20134 player competitive shop management game where <strong>gutsy pricing, clever shelf setups, and sneaky sabotage</strong> are your weapons in the market war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/9c444ed0a235dfbf303d964db3e43f6b.poster.avif?t=1755091090\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/9c444ed0a235dfbf303d964db3e43f6b.webm?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/9c444ed0a235dfbf303d964db3e43f6b.mp4?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Loop: 10 Days of Goblin Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with randomized economic scenarios that shift product prices and stock levels. Every day, players have limited time to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase products from the supplier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place shelves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set competitive prices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble at the <i>Wheel of Chance</i> for risky bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for customers in real time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once players flip their signs, sales begin: customers flow in, grab what they want, and check out at your register\u2014fast hands and calm nerves win gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/78b409b7ffe0282d1934ccafff6454e0.poster.avif?t=1755091090\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/78b409b7ffe0282d1934ccafff6454e0.webm?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/78b409b7ffe0282d1934ccafff6454e0.mp4?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sabotage &amp; Fountain of Luck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/784b9bb5ead41a29719cd4f7f2bdbcb9.poster.avif?t=1755091090\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/784b9bb5ead41a29719cd4f7f2bdbcb9.webm?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/784b9bb5ead41a29719cd4f7f2bdbcb9.mp4?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>crime syndicate</strong> has infiltrated the city. With a bit of coin, they\u2019ll <i>\u201credecorate\u201d</i> your rivals' shops, steal their goods, or drain their pockets. Fair, right?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/f272e4263a266ea61b7834c6956b0917.poster.avif?t=1755091090\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/f272e4263a266ea61b7834c6956b0917.webm?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/f272e4263a266ea61b7834c6956b0917.mp4?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheeky little <strong>fountain fairy</strong> now grants you 3 chances per day \u2014 buff your shop, debuff your rivals, run like Sonic, or slow others like turtles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>End-of-Day &amp; Witch Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each day, players:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Review profits and reputation gains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 3 mysterious Witch Cards: blessings or curses<br>(e.g., price hikes, shelf buffs, stealing rival fame)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card can turn the tides\u2014<strong>a well-timed curse could ruin a rival\u2019s empire</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/4a33fdfd80d94c349d0b95e98a1db772.poster.avif?t=1755091090\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/4a33fdfd80d94c349d0b95e98a1db772.webm?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/4a33fdfd80d94c349d0b95e98a1db772.mp4?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/046881833bb5adb16a33aa819e39534c.poster.avif?t=1755091090\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/046881833bb5adb16a33aa819e39534c.webm?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/046881833bb5adb16a33aa819e39534c.mp4?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart, fast-paced economic decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real player interactions: price wars, sabotage, psychological mind games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily randomness keeps each session fresh</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre goblin world filled with charm and chaos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade smart. Hex hard. Rule the goblin market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not capitalism. This is survival.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <i>Trade Rivals \u2013 Goblin Age</i>,</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic 2\u20134 player competitive shop management game where <strong>gutsy pricing, clever shelf setups, and sneaky sabotage</strong> are your weapons in the market war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/9c444ed0a235dfbf303d964db3e43f6b.poster.avif?t=1755091090\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/9c444ed0a235dfbf303d964db3e43f6b.webm?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/9c444ed0a235dfbf303d964db3e43f6b.mp4?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Loop: 10 Days of Goblin Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with randomized economic scenarios that shift product prices and stock levels. Every day, players have limited time to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase products from the supplier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place shelves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set competitive prices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble at the <i>Wheel of Chance</i> for risky bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for customers in real time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once players flip their signs, sales begin: customers flow in, grab what they want, and check out at your register\u2014fast hands and calm nerves win gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/78b409b7ffe0282d1