34c6956b0917.mp4?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheeky little <strong>fountain fairy</strong> now grants you 3 chances per day \u2014 buff your shop, debuff your rivals, run like Sonic, or slow others like turtles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>End-of-Day &amp; Witch Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each day, players:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Review profits and reputation gains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 3 mysterious Witch Cards: blessings or curses<br>(e.g., price hikes, shelf buffs, stealing rival fame)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card can turn the tides\u2014<strong>a well-timed curse could ruin a rival\u2019s empire</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/4a33fdfd80d94c349d0b95e98a1db772.poster.avif?t=1755091090\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/4a33fdfd80d94c349d0b95e98a1db772.webm?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/4a33fdfd80d94c349d0b95e98a1db772.mp4?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/046881833bb5adb16a33aa819e39534c.poster.avif?t=1755091090\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/046881833bb5adb16a33aa819e39534c.webm?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/046881833bb5adb16a33aa819e39534c.mp4?t=1755091090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart, fast-paced economic decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real player interactions: price wars, sabotage, psychological mind games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily randomness keeps each session fresh</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre goblin world filled with charm and chaos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade smart. Hex hard. Rule the goblin market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not capitalism. This is survival.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Build your goblin shop empire in this competitive goblin store management for 2\u20134 friends. Set prices, fight for fame, and sabotage rivals\u2014all in a race to survive 10 chaotic days. Outsmart, out-sell, or outlast your way to victory in Trade Rivals \u2013 Goblin Age!",
